fallow \r\n\r\nSorting Order\r\n1. material priority\r\n2. object depth\r\n3. stacked sorting offset for when depth is approximately the same\r\n4. surface index used because most other engines work in this way \r\n5. material depth used for next-pass sorting\r\n6. geometry id used for constant render sorting to make more predictable\r\n\r\nAlso added stacked sorting offset  for when the depth is the same but a user wants to render multiple layers of objects but don't want it effecting neighboring objects\r\n\r\nAfter fix\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d03875a-fe2c-4896-8e79-5416ff1940fc)\r\ngizmos no longer mess with sort\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe60fa34-1018-443b-b542-e7566472fdc6)\r\n\r\nBefore fix inconsistent sorting and flashing\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5aee232e-d195-4039-a39a-8a21968523c8)\r\ngizmos mess with sort\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/485b8d92-2822-4f53-b09f-5e172526b771)\r\n\r\nThe project I made for testing\r\n[project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20297001/project.zip)\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic: